{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37627","headline":"予尝有雪景一绝爲人所讽吟段赞善小笔精微忽爲图画以诗谢之 · 郑谷","name":"予尝有雪景一绝爲人所讽吟段赞善小笔精微忽爲图画以诗谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赞善贤相後，家藏名画多。\n留心於绘素，得事在烟波。\n属兴同吟咏，成功更琢磨。\n爱予风雪句，幽绝写渔蓑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}